WEBVTT

00:00:00.228 --> 00:00:04.179
At the end of the day, do your <b>cash count</b>

00:00:04.301 --> 00:00:10.970
MiCaja tells you the period, how many sales there were and the float you started with

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.911
Count the bills and coins in the drawer

00:00:13.963 --> 00:00:20.552
Type what you counted: MiCaja <b>doesn't tell you</b> what should be there, so the count is honest

00:00:20.656 --> 00:00:23.327
And how much you leave as float for tomorrow

00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:27.816
Confirm, and it tells you whether it <b>balances</b>, or is over or short

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:34.800
Print it to sign and keep with the money, or save it as an image
